OL,5,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,6,     FThe series that looks at books,
OL,7,     Fplays and stories and how they
OL,8,     Fwork. John Yorke shows how Dorothy
OL,9,     FL Sayers's ambitious 1930 crime
OL,10,     Fnovel pushed the boundaries of
OL,11,     Fdetective fiction.
OL,12,G1500 Strong Poison by Dorothy L Sayers
OL,13,     F1/2. Harry Lloyd stars as Dorothy
OL,14,     FL Sayers's aristocratic sleuth
OL,15,     FLord Peter Wimsey. With Clare
OL,16,     FCorbett as Harriet Vane and Celia
OL,17,     FImrie as the ever-resourceful Miss
OL,18,     FClimpson.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/11
