OL,5,G1700 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1985, Father Robert Prevost -
OL,7,     Fnow Pope Leo XIV - arrived in
OL,8,     FChulucanas for his first
OL,9,     Fmissionary assignment. Hector
OL,10,     FCamacho was his altar boy.
OL,11,G1710 The Value Crisis
OL,12,     F1/4. Ros Atkins investigates how
OL,13,     Ftechnology is changing what we
OL,14,     Fvalue, from friendship and culture
OL,15,     Fto finance and work, and asks
OL,16,     Fwhether these changes amount to a
OL,17,     Fcrisis.
