OL,6,     FA temporary ceasefire enabled
OL,7,     Fhundreds of civilians to finally
OL,8,     Fleave the Russian-occupied town of
OL,9,     FOleshky in southern Ukraine, where
OL,10,     Fthey had been trapped for three
OL,11,     Fyears.
